files, and everything in it is under a permissive licence. Nothing from it
except Electron ships in the app. The Android and Apple entries are from each
project's published licence and have not been checked against a resolved build,
which should be done the first time those apps compile. Bouncy Castle was checked
in the jar itself: it has no dependencies of its own.

